If :attr:`left`\ `= False`, this function returns the matrix :math:`X \in \mathbb{K}^{n \times k}` that
solves the system

.. math::

    XA = B\mathrlap{\qquad A \in \mathbb{K}^{k \times k}, B \in \mathbb{K}^{n \times k}.}

